  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "Universal Rules Updates",
    "summary": "Some rules replace the usual **[disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/disembark-move)** with another move:\n\n- When a rule lets the unit **declare a charge** after leaving a **TRANSPORT** model that did a **normal move** this turn, it makes an [assault disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/assault-disembark-move).\n- When a rule lets the unit get out of a **TRANSPORT** model that did an **advance move** this turn, it makes a [shock disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/shock-disembark-move).",
